# Testing Standards

See [project-guidelines.md](mdc:.clinerules/project-guidelines.md) §Documentation & Testing for full requirements.

• Unit tests for business logic (`WP_UnitTestCase` for PHP).
• Integration tests for API endpoints and shipping flows.
• E2E tests for critical user journeys with Playwright under `tests/e2e`.
• Keep fixtures in `tests/fixtures` and bootstrap via `tests/bootstrap.php`.